    <guid isPermaLink="false">671c48aa44ae79002c1d0022</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 26 Oct 2024 01:40:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>摸鱼（小红书-两点Yi线）</span></p><span></span><p><span>一欣（小红书-💕一 欣）</span></p><span></span><p><span>珊珊</span></p><span></span><p><span>梅姐</span></p><span></span><p><span>【导读】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目我们深度探讨了性教育和妇科病的重要性。家庭传统观念中，性教育常常被忽视，这导致了许多问题，尤其是女性在性健康方面的误解和隐患。从最小的婴幼儿妇科问题到成年女性的常见困扰，比如性生活后的不适和妇科检查的尴尬，嘉宾们都作出了详细解答。节目还揭示了许多关于女性性生活的谣言，提供了科学的解释和实际的建议，帮助女性更好地了解自己的身体，打破对性健康的羞耻与隐讳触动你的内心。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">00:02:04</a>:小女孩的隐秘困扰。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="244">00:04:04</a>:只是正常器官！揭秘女性生殖系统的基本常识！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="622">00:10:22</a>:揭开私密的面纱：了解女性生殖健康的重要性。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="829">00:13:49</a>:沟通与理解：夫妻之间的秘密对话。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1244">00:20:44</a>:如何正确使用避孕措施，避免意外怀孕！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1450">00:24:10</a>:科学避孕方法：月例规律降低、更年期症状改善，月经综合证解决方案。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">00:27:40</a>:婚前性行为，家长观点与现代性教育之争。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1868">00:31:08</a>:科普妇科常见问题及治疗方法，轻松解决女性健康困扰！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2074">00:34:34</a>:建议使用清水进行清洁，保持菌群平衡。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2283">00:38:03</a>:正确避孕，享受性生活，济南市卫生健康宣传教育中心的安全避孕方法。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【领取方法（限地区）】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkJOR1B8Kc-t9-FffYjUsnVVlNy8.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg9p8xeaCnWtUJTgm3yCokPuxh49.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnwQmSgKTujIKHWzmfd1dJtDYDZ2.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlrErnawZrvo_9ljkXe1bpMOcjuj.png">